{:title
 "Arrival, How a Message Reaches a Smile Instance and When It Lands",
 :description
 "What an arrival is in THE MAP of Smile, a message that says what has come, why, what it refers to and the context it carries, landing at a chosen rung from stopping the work to the turn boundary, and how my words reached it from August to September 2026, with every source.",
 :keywords
